1
00:01:02,140 --> 00:01:05,980
=The Cruel Tribunal=
=Episode 20=

2
00:01:06,280 --> 00:01:07,920
Lady Luan,

3
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:10,160
Commandery Princess Rousang,

4
00:01:10,240 --> 00:01:12,120
was gentle by nature

5
00:01:12,120 --> 00:01:13,960
and virtuous in character.

6
00:01:14,400 --> 00:01:16,800
Yet Heaven did not favor the good.

7
00:01:16,960 --> 00:01:18,760
She suddenly fell gravely ill,

8
00:01:18,920 --> 00:01:20,800
and no medicine could save her.

9
00:01:21,320 --> 00:01:24,040
She passed away
on the eve of her wedding.

10
00:01:24,520 --> 00:01:26,480
My heart is shattered,

11
00:01:26,600 --> 00:01:29,160
and the entire nation mourns with me.

12
00:01:46,160 --> 00:01:47,120
Miss Xiaobai.

13
00:01:47,640 --> 00:01:48,720
Miss Xiaobai.

14
00:01:49,280 --> 00:01:50,160
Miss Xiaobai!

15
00:01:52,280 --> 00:01:52,880
Rousang...

16
00:01:53,120 --> 00:01:54,000
Rousang...

17
00:01:54,280 --> 00:01:55,240
Miss Rousang

18
00:01:55,600 --> 00:01:56,480
took her own life

19
00:01:56,800 --> 00:01:57,840
at the wedding.

20
00:02:12,560 --> 00:02:13,800
Songpiao,

21
00:02:15,640 --> 00:02:17,120
you have your own path to follow.

22
00:02:18,840 --> 00:02:20,720
If I'm standing in your way,

23
00:02:22,360 --> 00:02:24,040
I won't ask for anything more.

24
00:02:27,040 --> 00:02:28,760
This is all my fault.

25
00:02:30,560 --> 00:02:32,160
Perhaps this was always

26
00:02:32,680 --> 00:02:34,320
how I was destined to end.

27
00:02:37,840 --> 00:02:40,160
I wish the fireworks that night

28
00:02:41,800 --> 00:02:43,240
could have stayed in the sky forever.

29
00:02:47,960 --> 00:02:49,120
Songpiao,

30
00:02:50,120 --> 00:02:51,760
in this vast sea of people,

31
00:02:52,840 --> 00:02:54,280
just meeting you

32
00:02:54,520 --> 00:02:56,760
was already
the greatest blessing I could ask for.

33
00:02:59,720 --> 00:03:00,840
Maybe in our next life.

34
00:03:02,200 --> 00:03:03,480
In our next life,

35
00:03:04,480 --> 00:03:06,320
I'll hold your hand again

36
00:03:07,720 --> 00:03:08,720
and slowly

37
00:03:09,760 --> 00:03:10,800
walk forward with you.

38
00:04:07,940 --> 00:04:21,580
(Happiness)

39
00:04:45,080 --> 00:04:45,960
Wait.

40
00:04:47,760 --> 00:04:48,760
Give me the lock.

41
00:05:03,560 --> 00:05:04,680
From now on,

42
00:05:07,280 --> 00:05:09,240
every door and window in her room

43
00:05:10,680 --> 00:05:12,200
must remain open forever.

44
00:05:14,960 --> 00:05:15,640
Yes.

45
00:06:05,920 --> 00:06:06,840
Are you satisfied now?

46
00:06:07,280 --> 00:06:09,440
You forced me
to sever all ties with Jiang Xiaobai,

47
00:06:10,000 --> 00:06:11,800
and then left Rousang no way out!

48
00:06:12,680 --> 00:06:14,320
What exactly are you trying to achieve?

49
00:06:15,000 --> 00:06:16,440
Did you really think I could stand by

50
00:06:16,440 --> 00:06:18,400
and watch you
nearly beat Jiang Xiaobai to death

51
00:06:19,200 --> 00:06:21,000
without feeling a thing,

52
00:06:21,720 --> 00:06:23,360
then continue obeying you

53
00:06:23,680 --> 00:06:25,600
like a heartless puppet?

54
00:06:26,000 --> 00:06:26,680
Is that so?

55
00:06:27,240 --> 00:06:29,400
Is this the outcome you wanted?

56
00:06:34,800 --> 00:06:37,000
Speaking to me with such conviction,

57
00:06:37,680 --> 00:06:39,800
you finally sound
somewhat like a heir to the throne.

58
00:06:45,600 --> 00:06:46,800
Then let me ask you this.

59
00:06:47,440 --> 00:06:49,920
What makes Jiang Xiaobai unworthy of me?

60
00:06:50,920 --> 00:06:53,040
You were born a commoner too.

61
00:06:54,280 --> 00:06:55,720
You were able to enter the palace

62
00:06:55,880 --> 00:06:56,840
and marry Father.

63
00:06:56,920 --> 00:06:58,480
Why can't Jiang Xiaobai do the same?

64
00:06:58,600 --> 00:06:59,400
Fine.

65
00:07:00,000 --> 00:07:02,000
I'll tell you exactly why she can't.

66
00:07:05,840 --> 00:07:07,000
You have a choice.

67
00:07:09,200 --> 00:07:11,000
You were born a prince.

68
00:07:12,480 --> 00:07:14,000
No matter what you do

69
00:07:14,200 --> 00:07:15,400
or where you go,

70
00:07:15,880 --> 00:07:17,800
you have me
and your father to cherish you.

71
00:07:18,600 --> 00:07:20,440
Whether you're right or wrong,

72
00:07:20,450 --> 00:07:21,940
there's always someone to protect you.

73
00:07:22,800 --> 00:07:24,440
You say you don't want the throne.

74
00:07:25,320 --> 00:07:27,840
You say you want
to choose whom you love.

75
00:07:28,200 --> 00:07:29,040
But what about me?

76
00:07:29,120 --> 00:07:30,040
What about your mother?

77
00:07:30,600 --> 00:07:32,040
Have you ever thought about me?

78
00:07:39,120 --> 00:07:40,040
In this world,

79
00:07:41,680 --> 00:07:43,360
a woman's life is worth next to nothing.

80
00:07:45,000 --> 00:07:46,360
While your father was well,

81
00:07:47,360 --> 00:07:48,800
he could still protect me.

82
00:07:50,200 --> 00:07:51,400
But now,

83
00:07:52,440 --> 00:07:54,200
your father is bedridden,

84
00:07:54,700 --> 00:07:56,350
and the kingdom is
about to be left without a ruler.

85
00:07:58,080 --> 00:07:58,960
My future

86
00:07:59,480 --> 00:08:00,880
depends entirely

87
00:08:00,880 --> 00:08:02,360
on you, my son.

88
00:08:04,200 --> 00:08:06,180
You can storm
into the palace over a mere commoner,

89
00:08:06,200 --> 00:08:08,520
Jiang Xiaobai,
and berate your own mother.

90
00:08:09,120 --> 00:08:10,840
But have you ever thought about me?

91
00:08:11,720 --> 00:08:13,120
I don't have a choice either.

92
00:08:15,200 --> 00:08:17,040
Since ancient times,
struggles for the throne

93
00:08:18,200 --> 00:08:21,040
have led
far too many brothers to turn against

94
00:08:21,840 --> 00:08:23,040
and kill one another.

95
00:08:24,480 --> 00:08:26,720
I don't want you and my father

96
00:08:27,400 --> 00:08:29,040
to witness such a tragedy,

97
00:08:30,520 --> 00:08:32,040
nor do I want to see my younger brother

98
00:08:33,200 --> 00:08:35,120
choose the wrong path one day

99
00:08:36,440 --> 00:08:39,080
and become caught up in such
a cruel and dishonorable struggle.

100
00:08:40,480 --> 00:08:42,600
I never had any interest in the throne.

101
00:08:44,240 --> 00:08:45,600
If Songpiao wants it,

102
00:08:47,240 --> 00:08:49,040
then I'm willing to give it to him.

103
00:08:51,520 --> 00:08:53,290
My brother is
neither heartless nor unfilial.

104
00:08:56,080 --> 00:08:57,600
Even if he inherits the throne,

105
00:08:59,800 --> 00:09:01,840
he will still treat you well, Mother.

106
00:09:02,720 --> 00:09:03,920
But you're my only

107
00:09:03,920 --> 00:09:06,040
biological son.

108
00:09:07,440 --> 00:09:09,880
Songpiao is not my own flesh and blood.

109
00:09:51,880 --> 00:09:53,560
My body and life

110
00:09:55,560 --> 00:09:56,960
were given to me by my parents.

111
00:10:45,680 --> 00:10:46,960
From this day forward,

112
00:10:49,560 --> 00:10:50,960
consider me

113
00:10:53,640 --> 00:10:54,600
gone.

114
00:11:19,440 --> 00:11:20,800
By order of Her Highness,

115
00:11:20,880 --> 00:11:21,760
the First Prince

116
00:11:21,770 --> 00:11:23,790
is not permitted to leave
the palace without authorization.

117
00:11:37,770 --> 00:11:40,370
♪The candle
burns down to its final glow♪

118
00:11:41,330 --> 00:11:43,730
♪Cold fragrance clings to my hem♪

119
00:11:44,370 --> 00:11:46,130
♪You gently smooth my hair♪

120
00:11:46,130 --> 00:11:49,050
♪Yet your gaze drifts far away♪

121
00:11:51,490 --> 00:11:53,930
♪A hidden blade lies beneath your smile♪

122
00:11:54,290 --> 00:11:57,610
♪You turn away
as if nothing has changed♪

123
00:11:58,210 --> 00:11:59,770
♪Step by step, I walk away♪

124
00:11:59,930 --> 00:12:03,250
♪Each step breaks my heart anew♪

125
00:12:06,010 --> 00:12:08,890
♪If fate had not gone astray♪

126
00:12:09,410 --> 00:12:12,490
♪Why leave me
standing alone in the wind?♪

127
00:12:12,930 --> 00:12:15,530
♪We shared one fleeting life together♪

128
00:12:15,530 --> 00:12:19,570
♪Yet all that's left
is warmth upon my fingertips♪

129
00:12:19,810 --> 00:12:22,850
♪I'd melt this night into ink♪

130
00:12:23,250 --> 00:12:25,930
♪And write
of every meeting and every parting♪

131
00:12:25,930 --> 00:12:28,650
♪If next life asks
about the days gone by♪

132
00:12:28,930 --> 00:12:31,890
♪I'll only say that once♪

133
00:12:32,370 --> 00:12:34,130
♪I called your name♪

134
00:12:38,730 --> 00:12:40,970
♪The silent stars hang low♪

135
00:12:42,370 --> 00:12:44,570
♪The river keeps flowing east♪

136
00:12:45,810 --> 00:12:47,730
♪I linger in the old tower♪

137
00:12:47,850 --> 00:12:51,490
♪Waiting for you,
though all is now empty♪

138
00:12:52,810 --> 00:12:55,250
♪This life still owes us a bow♪

139
00:12:56,130 --> 00:12:58,930
♪May the next repay us with a dream♪

140
00:12:59,690 --> 00:13:01,930
♪Beyond here lie
endless mountains and rivers♪

141
00:13:01,930 --> 00:13:08,170
♪I dare not turn for one last look♪

142
00:13:08,450 --> 00:13:11,330
♪If fate had not gone astray♪

143
00:13:11,930 --> 00:13:15,410
♪Why bury this heart beneath the frost?♪

144
00:13:15,410 --> 00:13:18,050
♪We shared one fleeting life together♪

145
00:13:18,050 --> 00:13:22,330
♪Now only
fading warmth remains in my palm♪

146
00:13:22,330 --> 00:13:25,250
♪I'd melt this night into ink♪

147
00:13:25,690 --> 00:13:28,410
♪And paint a winter between your brows♪

148
00:13:28,410 --> 00:13:31,090
♪If we meet again in another life♪

149
00:13:31,410 --> 00:13:34,130
♪Will you believe that tonight♪

150
00:13:34,810 --> 00:13:37,090
♪Was when we first met?♪

151
00:13:38,370 --> 00:13:40,770
♪Will you believe that tonight♪

152
00:13:41,890 --> 00:13:43,650
♪Was when we met for the last time?♪
